# NAS may relay encrypted SSH only to the existing Tokyo node.
Match User yeutech-tokyo-relay
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    AllowTcpForwarding local
    PermitOpen 47.79.89.19:22
    PermitListen none
    AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTTY no
    PermitTunnel no
    GatewayPorts no
    ForceCommand /usr/sbin/nologin
Match all
